<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<chapter xml:id="ch17-chapter-more-eda" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Exploring Data</title>

  <introduction>
    <p> This chapter will encourage students to think about sources of variation and help with the development of multivariable thinking. This is mainly accomplished through a full data exploration of a large data set. Students will be introduced to addition methods/visualizations for exploring data.</p>
  </introduction>

  <objectives>
    <ol>
    <li>Explore...</li>

    <li>Learn...</li>

    <li>Understand...</li>

    <li>Apply...</li>
  </ol>
  </objectives>

